  "experiences": [
    {
      "companyName": "CISTUP@IISc",
      "companyLogo": "/images/experience/IISc_logo.jpg",
      "role": "Full-stack Developer (SDE)",
      "type": "Full Time",
      "duration": "DEC 2023 - Present",
      "location": "Bangalore",
      "contributions": [
        "DST Production Platform: Designed and shipped the Digital Survey Tool (live at surveys.cistup.iisc.ac.in / oshr.cistup.iisc.ac.in) — React 18 + TypeScript frontend, Python Flask + psycopg3 backend, PostgreSQL with PostGIS geospatial schema — serving 10,000+ household surveys across 40+ field enumerators for the Govt. of Karnataka 'City-Scale Travel Demand Model' project (funded by Govt. of India and DULT).",
        "API & Data Model: Designed 39 REST endpoints with 3-tier RBAC (Admin / Superuser / Enumerator); modeled the survey schema in PostgreSQL + PostGIS and sized the psycopg connection pool against 8 gunicorn workers (min=1 / max=4 per worker → 32 peak connections) for predictable capacity under load.",
        "Frontend Complexity: Built a 6-page survey form with 16 trip modes, conditional fields, and auto-population from each prior trip's destination; integrated Google Maps Places API (autocomplete + draggable marker + current-location); built a custom SearchableDropdown with 3-tier matching; 15-min cross-tab idle timeout via localStorage events (30s poll, not per-keystroke); token-refresh mutex pattern (proactive setTimeout + reactive 401 interceptor + singleton mutex preventing concurrent /refresh races).",
        "Auth & Security: Implemented JWT auth (HS256, 15-min access + 7-day rotating refresh tokens, bcrypt-hashed, rotated on every /refresh), mandatory TOTP 2FA via PyOTP for Admin/Superuser, and server-side reCAPTCHA v3 verification.",
        "DevOps & CI/CD: Productionized with Docker Compose (nginx + flask + postgres on an isolated bridge network) and a GitHub Actions self-hosted runner on a private VPN (cloud runners couldn't reach the network — fixed SELinux blockers with `chcon -t bin_t`, NTP drift with chronyd makestep, used ed25519 deploy keys); zero-downtime deploys via `docker compose up -d --no-deps flask`; SAST (Bandit) + SCA (pip-audit) gated in CI.",
        "VAPT & Hardening: Cleared the ISO VAPT security audit in a single review round (May 2026 — all 6 findings closed); remediated HTTP Request Smuggling (upgraded Nginx 1.14→1.26 on EOL CentOS 8.5 using dnf module reset, added proxy_http_version 1.1 + empty Connection header); shipped 7 security headers with the `always` flag, HSTS preload-ready, CSP tuned for reCAPTCHA; Nginx rate limits (5/min on auth, 30/min elsewhere) and disabled source maps in the production bundle.",
        "ATDM Ground-Truth Data: Built a 10-worker Python + Selenium scraper to harvest Google Maps route, travel-time, transit, and fare data across 4 time-of-day windows — generating 2M+ data points over 500K+ trips to estimate and validate the Aggregate Travel Demand Model. Zero infra cost; equivalent to ~₹5.7L (~$6.7k) of Google Directions API spend avoided.",
        "ATDM Performance: Optimized the Aggregate Travel Demand Model (QGIS plugin built jointly with BOSCH and IISc) by migrating long-running Python modules to C++ via Eigen — delivered 95% runtime reduction for Govt. of Karnataka traffic forecasting and urban planning workloads."
      ],
